{"lines":[{"w":0.051903114318847657,"h":0.013296011196641033,"t":"Test 3","x":0.086505190155932346,"y":0.06088173562752508,"c":1},{"y":0.10901162797913988,"t":"READING PASSAGE 3","x":0.084775085450711177,"w":0.26124567667643228,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1},{"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 27-40, which are based on Reading","w":0.71799306233723958,"h":0.019047919314086115,"c":1,"y":0.14680232560959028,"x":0.086505198827575971},{"t":"Passage 3 below.","x":0.084775084310665674,"y":0.16569767412622338,"h":0.01744186102384615,"c":1,"w":0.14359862009684243},{"t":"Rethinking the Past","x":0.30968857511577996,"w":0.27508651733398437,"y":0.20639534938266213,"c":1,"h":0.027684427292051672},{"h":0.019304722651808048,"t":"It is by now a truism that the story of human evolution is being rethought. Discoveries","y":0.24988947681683216,"c":1,"x":0.082995700795732902,"w":0.67656366984049476},{"x":0.084686458686479865,"y":0.26740408913115976,"w":0.67490122477213543,"t":"have come thick and fast over the last decade or so, and these have forced us to rethink","h":0.020182058976362383,"c":1},{"h":0.021045731530479839,"y":0.28593202778479732,"c":1,"t":"many crucial points, such as how old our species is - about 300,000 years old as opposed to","w":0.70946767171223957,"x":0.084712779054599133},{"y":0.30402659495159368,"x":0.083003008328850658,"h":0.020215212005764815,"c":1,"t":"200,000 - and what extinct hominins, such as our cousins the Neanderthals, were really like.","w":0.71808517456054688},{"c":1,"w":0.69204152425130205,"t":"But because there are so many species and eras involved, it's hard to discern the common","x":0.084775085526632571,"y":0.32400279948348598,"h":0.019020456296735322},{"h":0.017514077327399957,"y":0.34149755084279187,"c":1,"x":0.083044983678039988,"w":0.16955017089843755,"t":"threads linking them."},{"c":1,"t":"However, I do think it's possible to draw out some overall messages from the blizzard of","h":0.018540339673458028,"y":0.37788456667149384,"x":0.084727343805290289,"w":0.68347437540690104},{"y":0.39487590948247941,"t":"archaeological finds in recent years. Two things stand out to me. One is the growing evidence","c":1,"w":0.72156748453776043,"h":0.020762605713830262,"x":0.082994802944178145},{"c":1,"w":0.6852356465657552,"h":0.020147558523275544,"x":0.082985937426547404,"t":"that many supposedly 'advanced' behaviours, such as architecture and art, can be traced","y":0.41332888807468504},{"t":"much further back in time than we thought, often to hominin species that existed before","x":0.082995247253232901,"w":0.68522989908854171,"h":0.01896495098330242,"c":1,"y":0.43269159797446344},{"h":0.017524248741155213,"c":1,"t":"modern humans. And the other is that we have badly misunderstood gender roles in","y":0.45203488343910869,"w":0.65397923787434897,"x":0.083044983054638005},{"h":0.018976720085170706,"c":1,"y":0.46947674420841956,"t":"prehistoric societies, imposing patriarchal values onto cultures that had very different ideas","x":0.083044987854824517,"w":0.70934254964192711},{"x":0.082881461329185363,"w":0.26684486389160156,"y":0.48609486640737509,"h":0.019817011935298834,"c":1,"t":"about how women should behave."},{"w":0.68712183634440105,"h":0.023392601894114295,"t":"Let's start with architecture. At Kalambo Falls in Zambia, researchers found buried logs","y":0.52180259581647281,"c":1,"x":0.084639134405597741},{"t":"that had been shaped with stone tools so that they interlocked. They seem to have once been","w":0.72145329793294266,"y":0.54198740360543318,"x":0.083044977971244979,"h":0.019059107802479769,"c":1},{"x":0.083044970282926248,"y":0.56088173555388021,"w":0.6885813395182292,"h":0.019060124877118167,"t":"part of a larger structure, perhaps a building. This would be unsurprising if they weren't","c":1},{"t":"476,000 years old. That's almost 200,000 years before our species, Homo sapiens, evolved.","y":0.57977606695806028,"w":0.69723185221354167,"h":0.020643806857942648,"c":1,"x":0.083044973392953622},{"t":"Extinct hominins also managed to settle in extreme places. For instance, we now know that","w":0.70950149536132812,"y":0.59522249131469185,"c":1,"h":0.021741766292286413,"x":0.082970079925200751},{"w":0.71626296997070316,"h":0.0175557800570596,"c":1,"t":"extinct hominins such as the Denisovans lived on the frozen heights of high-altitude regions","x":0.083044985515477385,"y":0.61616515045259235},{"w":0.69041071573893231,"h":0.019940128686796843,"c":1,"t":"200,000 years ago - upending the old notion that such environments were only settled by","x":0.082994596182937808,"y":0.63415275089179568},{"w":0.32213546752929689,"c":1,"h":0.020641607867828871,"t":"modern humans around 3,600 years ago.","x":0.082883271542391695,"y":0.65196741448314732},{"y":0.6903428971131137,"x":0.083044977328261591,"t":"Art also seems to have been invented by older hominins. We have had evidence for a","h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"w":0.65224914550781254},{"w":0.65581344604492187,"t":"long time now that Neanderthals painted on cave walls. Even earlier species, such as","x":0.081261193229945405,"y":0.70709269624538118,"h":0.01983709382043175,"c":1},{"t":"Homo erectus, may also have made art, for example by engraving patterns on shells.","y":0.72673198020098895,"x":0.083044991295076989,"h":0.017494751574527623,"w":0.64878890991210936,"c":1},{"y":0.74418604622781348,"w":0.66608998616536463,"x":0.083044972158561214,"h":0.017535437229548867,"t":"By far the most contentious claim in this area is that Homo naledi made art. H. naledi","c":1},{"w":0.65224914550781243,"x":0.081314873510961741,"h":0.018934000280872776,"t":"lived around 250,000 years ago, making it a contemporary of our species. However,","c":1,"y":0.76308139537692532},{"y":0.78050706038561557,"h":0.019976312918960071,"c":1,"x":0.081253684648381272,"w":0.64889333089192713,"t":"it had quite a small brain, typical of older hominins - and was therefore, according"},{"w":0.65410257975260422,"c":1,"h":0.021455592588580763,"y":0.79789056446900797,"t":"to palacoanthropological dogma, incapable of complex behaviours. Nevertheless, in","x":0.081255857962483594},{"y":0.81626009842112057,"w":0.65937581380208332,"h":0.021001371326273,"x":0.081224055545280158,"t":"the Rising Star cave system in South Africa where the H. naledi remains were found,","c":1},{"w":0.68708145141601562,"h":0.021396600257441056,"c":1,"x":0.081211249738603608,"t":"researchers have found what seem to be etchings - resembling rudimentary artwork - on","y":0.83405254075664559},{"c":1,"w":0.43425603230794274,"y":0.85465116296068122,"t":"the cave walls, though these have yet to be firmly dated.","x":0.081314893339973229,"h":0.017441859689102501},{"w":0.6921988423665365,"h":0.020490335367041257,"c":1,"y":0.88944835877437811,"t":"To say these claims about H. naledi are controversial is to understate the situation. Many","x":0.081231655360314417},{"x":0.081314874656471456,"y":0.90972708180520578,"c":1,"t":"experts say the evidence presented so far is completely inadequate to support them. The","h":0.017598499861357531,"w":0.68339101155598958},{"w":0.70415227254231771,"h":0.017599516935995818,"x":0.08131486709562305,"c":1,"t":"dispute has only been heightened by the way the results were released, in a non-traditional","y":0.92862141357360162},{"h":0.014534884186538477,"t":"68","x":0.081314879254466302,"w":0.022491348584493004,"c":1,"y":0.95930232528252357}],"w":2400,"h":2857}